efixes: I","Interface name `QueryBuilder` must have one of the following prefixes: I","Interface name `UnitOfWork` must have one of the following prefixes: I","The `{}` (\"empty object\") type allows any non-nullish value, including literals like `0` and `\"\"`.\n- If that's what you want, disable this lint rule with an inline comment or configure the 'allowObjectTypes' rule option.\n- If you want a type meaning \"any object\", you probably want `object` instead.\n- If you want a type meaning \"any value\", you probably want `unknown` instead.","noEmptyObject",["48774","48775"],["48776","48777"],{"range":"48778","text":"48779"},"Interface name `ServiceProvider` must have one of the following prefixes: I",{"range":"48780","text":"48781"},"Union type LifeTime constituents must be sorted.",{"range":"48782","text":"48783"},"Interface name `Registration` must have one of the following prefixes: I",["48784","48785"],["48786","48787"],["48788","48789"],["48790","48791"],"Missing JSDoc @param \"token\" declaration.",{"range":"48792","text":"48793"},"Missing JSDoc @param \"factory\" declaration.",{"range":"48794","text":"48795"},"Missing JSDoc @param \"lifetime\" declaration.",{"range":"48796","text":"48797"},{"range":"48798","text":"48799"},{"range":"48800","text":"48801"},{"range":"48802","text":"48803"},{"range":"48804","text":"48805"},{"range":"48806","text":"48807"},{"range":"48808","text":"48809"},{"range":"48810","text":"48811"},"Missing JSDoc @param \"instance\" declaration.",{"range":"48812","text":"48813"},{"range":"48814","text":"48815"},["48816"],"Prefer using nullish coalescing operator (`??=`) instead of an assignment expression, as it is simpler to read.","preferNullishOverAssignment",["48817"],["48818"],"Invalid type \"never\" of template literal expression.",{"range":"48819","text":"48820"},["48821"],{"range":"48822","text":"48823"},{"range":"48824","text":"48825"},["48826","48827"],"Argument 'target' should be typed with a non-any type.","anyTypedArg",["488