ntName on an `any` value.","Object Literal Method name `set_permission` must match one of the following formats: camelCase","Object Literal Method name `update_threshold` must match one of the following formats: camelCase","Object Literal Method name `schedule_task` must match one of the following formats: camelCase","Unsafe member access .taskName on an `any` value.",["61009","61010","61011"],["61012"],"react/no-unstable-nested-components","Do not define components during render. React will see a new component type on every render and destroy the entire subtree’s DOM nodes and state (https://reactjs.org/docs/reconciliation.html#elements-of-different-types). Instead, move this component definition out of the parent component “HybridConfigPanel” and pass data as props.",{"range":"61013","text":"61014"},["61015"],{"range":"61016","text":"61017"},{"range":"61018","text":"61014"},{"range":"61019","text":"61020"},{"range":"61021","text":"61020"},{"range":"61022","text":"46702"},{"range":"61023","text":"61024"},{"range":"61025","text":"60703"},["61026","61027"],["61028","61029","61030"],{"range":"61031","text":"61032"},"'Paper' is defined but never used.","'ListItemSecondaryAction' is defined but never used.",{"range":"61033","text":"46324"},{"range":"61034","text":"61035"},"'LinkIcon' is defined but never used.","'LinkOffIcon' is defined but never used.",{"range":"61036","text":"46322"},"Interface name `IntegrationCardProps` trimmed as `ntegrationCardProps` must match one of the following formats: PascalCase",{"range":"61037","text":"46432"},["61038","61039"],["61040"],{"range":"61041","text":"61042"},{"range":"61043","text":"61044"},["61045"],["61046"],["61047"],["61048"],{"range":"61049","text":"61050"},{"range":"61051","text":"61052"},["61053"],{"range":"61054","text":"61055"},["61056"],{"range":"61057","text":"46432"},["61058"],["61059"],["61060"],["61061"],["61062","61063"],"Async arrow function 'loadIntegrations' has no 'await' expression.",["61064"],"'err' is defi